{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手衛蘭（ Janice）一共四場《JANICE VIDAL衛蘭OUT OF FRAME世界巡迴演唱會－香港站》，今晚（18號）在紅館舉行最後一場。</p><p>尾場有陳明憙、關心妍、丁子高和太太楊千嬅、JW（王灝兒）和丈夫王至尊、AGA（江海迦）與未婚</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:15:39.795722+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:31:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:08:53.708919+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:08:53.708919+00:00","content_hash":"2d0fdbf504e37e09ac59376a39b0a1428bcbd5c657975175a8940d4fbf9c6589","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}